Juiblex and co. (named demons) are covetous monsters and therefore
cannot be tamed. Covetous monsters want the amulet and will steal it
if possible. In fact, if the Wizard, an arch-lich, a named demon, or
other covetous monster is present in Moloch's sanctum, they will kill
the high priest and steal the amulet given the chance. ;) I believe a
recent hacker discovered this when he found the high priest dead, then
obtained the AoY after disposing of Yeenoghu.

If you want to tame a demon, I believe you must be polymorphed into a
demon yourself. If you really want a pet demon, I believe that one of
the demon polymorphs has a chance of summoning more demons as pets
every so often but am unsure of which one it is. Alternately,
polymorph your kitten.



